ms/Problem_64\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 64\">64</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_65\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 65\">65</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_66\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 66\">66</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_67\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 67\">67</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_68\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 68\">68</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_69\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 69\">69</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_70\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 70\">70</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_71\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 71\">71</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_72\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 72\">72</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_73\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 73\">73</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_74\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 74\">74</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_75\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 75\">75</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_76\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 76\">76</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_77\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 77\">77</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_78\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 78\">78</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_79\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 79\">79</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_80\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Prob